      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Should the regression test also cover a snapshot database whose LOCK is held by another process?\n\ntACK 15a891d4021e0cf8c009127721ee1f1702dd9471\n\nTested on Linux aarch64 (Debian 13, GCC 14.2.0):\n- `restart-retry-pruned`, `restart-retry-default`, `readable-leftover-retry`, and `locked-leftover-retry` passed. The locked case returned RPC error `-1`, left the database files unchanged, and the retry succeeded after the lock was released.\n- `feature_assumeutxo.py` passed in a direct slot run on the same head.\n",
